  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Food Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the nutritional and health status of beneficiaries through the provision of timely, sustainable, and equitable access to safe water supply, sanitation, and hygiene services, quality, lifesaving health care services, and household access to basic food baskets, wash non-food items and cooking provisions of the most vulnerable idps and host communities.</narrative>
  </description>
